    >>> jit_unique = jax.jit(jnp.unique, static_argnames=['size'])
    >>> jit_unique(x, size=3)
    Array([1, 3, 4], dtype=int32)

    If your static size is smaller than the true number of unique values, they will be truncated.

    >>> jit_unique(x, size=2)
